From 4366734c3afbbc9d3fc9d64ccdfb1c5c6721d1d6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 04:30:27 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] Skip unchanged cursor-eligible partition repair
 scans

Preserve scan ordering and remote-parent refresh. Memoize pre-scan content revisions with handle/file fences; refuse publication when either cursor changes during the pass.

Proof: sync-level primary/shadow regression failed on parent; 182 focused tests passed. Deterministic 1200-task/1199-link/300-chat live+replica replay exactly matches repeated parent stores, schemas, outbox, service, results and wakes. Primary event-only median 8.714/8.967 ms parent/control vs 4.250 ms candidate; shadow 3.393/3.506 vs 3.184. Not whole-gateway or Mac acceptance.
